                <button class="w-full flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-left focus:outline-none group" 
                        onclick="document.getElementById('faq-ans-6').classList.toggle('hidden'); this.querySelector('span.icon').classList.toggle('rotate-180')">
                    <span class="text-lg font-serif text-theme-green pr-8">Q. When is the possession scheduled?  </span>
                    <span class="icon transform transition-transform duration-300 text-accent-gold">▼</span>
